{"path":"thread/stop_source/swap2","title":"swap(std::stop_source)","titleHtml":"swap<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::stop_source)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/stop_source/swap2","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Overloads the std::swap algorithm for std::stop_source. Exchanges the stop-state of lhs with that of rhs. Effectively calls lhs.swap(rhs).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> stop_source<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs, stop_source<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Overloads the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/swap\">std::swap</a></span> algorithm for <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/stop_source\">std::stop_source</a></span>. Exchanges the stop-state of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs</span></code> with that of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code>. Effectively calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">swap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>This function  is not visible to ordinary <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/unqualified_lookup\">unqualified</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/qualified_lookup\">qualified lookup</a>, and can only be found by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/adl\">argument-dependent lookup</a> when std::stop_source is an associated class of the arguments.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> <code>stop_source</code>s to swap\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/stop_source","title":"std::stop_source"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"swap(std::stop_source)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Overloads the std::swap algorithm for std::stop_source. Exchanges the stop-state of lhs with that of rhs."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"lhs, rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":67,"codeBlockCount":0}
